return A.k(A.dB(a,p,$.hO===B.bn?"Dataene dine blir p\xe5 telefonen.\n\n\u2022 Alt du legger inn i Chrimuh (gaver, folk, husholdninger, budsjetter, notater og fremdrift) lagres bare i appens egen lagring p\xe5 denne enheten. Det finnes ingen konto, og ingenting sendes til oss eller til noen server vi driver.\n\n\u2022 Appen tar vare p\xe5 noen automatiske kopier p\xe5 enheten (forrige versjon og \xe9n kopi per dag den siste uken), s\xe5 dataene kan hentes tilbake hvis en lagring g\xe5r galt.\n\n\u2022 Hvis sikkerhetskopi er sl\xe5tt p\xe5 p\xe5 telefonen (iCloud eller Google), er appens data med i den, og den h\xe5ndteres av Apple eller Google.\n\n\u2022 Eksporter data lager en fil som du selv bestemmer hvor lagres eller sendes. Import leser en fil du velger. Ingenting deles uten at du gj\xf8r det.\n\n\u2022 Appen g\xe5r bare p\xe5 nett n\xe5r den m\xe5: for \xe5 sjekke priser \xe5pner den butikksidene og prissammenligningssidene (som Prisjakt) du har lagt inn; s\xf8k p\xe5 prissammenligningssider \xe5pnes i nettleseren; og n\xe5r du bytter valuta, henter den dagens valutakurs fra Den europeiske sentralbanken (via frankfurter.dev) \xe9n gang for \xe5 regne om bel\xf8pene. Disse foresp\xf8rslene inneholder ingen personopplysninger.\n\n\u2022 Ingen analyse, ingen sporing og ingen reklame.\n\n\u2022 Nullstill appdata sletter det du velger. Sletter du appen, slettes alt som er lagret p\xe5 enheten.":"Your data stays on your phone.\n\n\u2022 Everything you add in Chrimuh (gifts, people, households, budgets, notes and progress) is saved only in the app's own storage on this device. There is no account, and nothing is sent to us or to any server we run.\n\n\u2022 The app keeps a few automatic copies on the device (the previous version and one copy per day for the last week), so your data can be recovered if a save goes wrong.\n\n\u2022 If your phone's backup is turned on (iCloud or Google), the app's data is included in that backup, handled by Apple or Google.\n\n\u2022 Export data creates a file that you decide where to save or send. Import reads a file you choose. Nothing is shared without you doing it.\n\n\u2022 The app only goes online when it needs to: to check prices, it opens the store pages and price comparison pages (like Prisjakt) you have linked; price comparison searches open in your browser; and when you change currency, it fetches that day's exchange rate from the European Central Bank (via frankfurter.dev) once, to convert your amounts. These requests contain no personal information.\n\n\u2022 No analytics, no tracking and no ads.\n\n\u2022 Reset app data deletes what you choose. Deleting the app deletes everything stored on the device."),$async$kt)
